      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "When the Louis and North Arkansas Railroad arrived in 1901, a new depot was built a mile from Green Forest’s public square.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
        13,
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Green_Forest%2C_Arkansas",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By 1927 Green Forest housed a First National Bank, a marble and granite works, a tomato cannery, and a car dealership in a former cotton gin.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21,
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
